  "semantics": "The two sheets are the PSL_2 orbits in the frozen factorization-difference coordinates. Restriction decoders certify the zero-sum hyperplane images; the displayed second-moment matrices, radical vectors, separating levels, and affine generator actions are the only finite inputs intended for the Lean leaves.",
  "statement_adequacy": [
